nanouav run r18 compare docs/research/r24/eval_forest_pilots_keep_tilt_edge.json+docs/research/r24/eval_forest_pilots_keep_tilt_edge_s1010.json results/r18/eval_forest_diffphys.json

# Almacén, con Unity
